{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42199","headline":"得浙西郝判官书未及报闻燕王移镇京口因寄此诗问方判官田书记消息 · 徐铉","name":"得浙西郝判官书未及报闻燕王移镇京口因寄此诗问方判官田书记消息","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风海上久离居，曾得刘公一纸书。\n淡水心情长若此，银钩踪迹更无如。\n尝忧座侧飞鴞鸟，未暇江中觅鲤鱼。\n今日京吴建朱邸，问君谁共曳长裾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}